<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Dokumentasi API' }) %>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>

<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 w-full">
  <span class="tag bg-[--blue]">API Reference</span>
  <h1 class="font-display text-5xl mt-2">Dokumentasi API</h1>
  <p class="mt-3 font-semibold">Integrasikan pembayaran QRIS ke web / bot kamu. Semua endpoint memakai <code class="bg-[--ink] text-[--paper] px-1 rounded-sm">curl -X GET</code> dan mengembalikan <code class="bg-[--ink] text-[--paper] px-1 rounded-sm">application/json</code>.</p>

  <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">
    <section class="card brutal-lg p-6 bg-[--yellow]">
      <span class="tag bg-[--ink] text-[--paper]">1 · Kunci API</span>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl mt-2">Dapatkan API Key</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 font-semibold text-sm">Login, klik menu <b>Developer</b>, lalu tekan <b>Buat API Key Baru</b>. Pakai value tersebut sebagai parameter <code>api_key</code> di semua request.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card brutal-lg p-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="tag bg-[--mint]">2 · Buat Pembayaran</span><span class="font-display text-xl">GET</span></div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl mt-2">/api/payment</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 font-semibold text-sm">Membuat permintaan pembayaran QRIS baru. Pembayaran kadaluarsa dalam 30 menit.</p>
      <div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full b-table text-sm min-w-[480px]">
        <thead class="bg-[--paper]">
          <tr><th class="p-2 text-left">Parameter</th><th class="p-2 text-left">Tipe</th><th class="p-2 text-left">Keterangan</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td class="p-2 font-bold">api_key</td><td class="p-2">string</td><td class="p-2">API key akun kamu (wajib)</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="p-2 font-bold">amount</td><td class="p-2">int</td><td class="p-2">Nominal 1.000 – 5.000.000 (IDR)</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="p-2 font-bold">external_id</td><td class="p-2">string</td><td class="p-2">(opsional) ID transaksi dari sistem kamu</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      </div>
      <pre class="mt-4 bg-[--ink] text-[--paper] brutal-sm p-4 text-sm overflow-x-auto">curl -X GET \
  "http://localhost:3000/api/payment?api_key=KUNCI_LAKU&amount=25000&external_id=INV-001"</pre>
      <div class="mt-3 font-bold text-sm uppercase">Response</div>
      <pre class="mt-1 bg-[--ink] text-[--paper] brutal-sm p-4 text-sm overflow-x-auto">{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "id": "PAY_AbCdEf123456XxYyZz",
    "external_id": "INV-001",
    "amount": 25000,
    "status": "pending",
    "qr_url": "https://athars.space/uploads/QRIS-....png",
    "payment_url": "http://localhost:3000/payment?id=PAY_AbCdEf123456XxYyZz",
    "expired_at": "2026-09-22T12:34:56.000Z"
  }
}</pre>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold">👉 Arahkan pelanggan kamu ke <code class="bg-[--ink] text-[--paper] px-1 rounded-sm">payment_url</code>, atau tampilkan <code class="bg-[--ink] text-[--paper] px-1 rounded-sm">qr_url</code> langsung, lalu poll status pakai endpoint berikut.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card brutal-lg p-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="tag bg-[--blue]">3 · Cek Status</span><span class="font-display text-xl">GET</span></div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl mt-2">/api/payment/check</h2>
      <div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full b-table text-sm min-w-[480px]">
        <thead class="bg-[--paper]">
          <tr><th class="p-2 text-left">Parameter</th><th class="p-2 text-left">Tipe</th><th class="p-2 text-left">Keterangan</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td class="p-2 font-bold">id</td><td class="p-2">string</td><td class="p-2">Payment ID dari response create</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      </div>
      <pre class="mt-4 bg-[--ink] text-[--paper] brutal-sm p-4 text-sm overflow-x-auto">curl -X GET \
  "http://localhost:3000/api/payment/check?id=PAY_AbCdEf123456XxYyZz"</pre>
      <div class="mt-3 font-bold text-sm uppercase">Response</div>
      <pre class="mt-1 bg-[--ink] text-[--paper] brutal-sm p-4 text-sm overflow-x-auto">{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "id": "PAY_AbCdEf123456XxYyZz",
    "external_id": "INV-001",
    "amount": 25000,
    "status": "paid",
    "paid_at": "2026-09-22T12:40:01.000Z"
  }
}</pre>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold">💰 Status <code class="bg-[--ink] text-[--paper] px-1 rounded-sm">paid</code> berarti pembayaran diterima dan saldo akun kamu sudah bertambah.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card brutal-lg p-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="tag bg-[--pink]">4 · Cek Saldo</span><span class="font-display text-xl">GET</span></div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl mt-2">/api/balance</h2>
      <div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full b-table text-sm min-w-[480px]">
        <thead class="bg-[--paper]">
          <tr><th class="p-2 text-left">Parameter</th><th class="p-2 text-left">Tipe</th><th class="p-2 text-left">Keterangan</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td class="p-2 font-bold">api_key</td><td class="p-2">string</td><td class="p-2">API key akun kamu (wajib)</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      </div>
      <pre class="mt-4 bg-[--ink] text-[--paper] brutal-sm p-4 text-sm overflow-x-auto">curl -X GET \
  "http://localhost:3000/api/balance?api_key=KUNCI_LAKU"</pre>
      <div class="mt-3 font-bold text-sm uppercase">Response</div>
      <pre class="mt-1 bg-[--ink] text-[--paper] brutal-sm p-4 text-sm overflow-x-auto">{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "username": "glngadttya",
    "balance": 250000,
    "currency": "IDR",
    "formatted": "Rp250.000"
  }
}</pre>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/foot') %>